da x foreign note=Italian/Portuguese particle in names (Leonardo da Vinci)
damn intj
dB x abbr note=decibel(s)
de x foreign note=French/Spanish/Portuguese particle in names and phrases (de facto, Charles de Gaulle)
dear intj note=oh dear, dear me
der x foreign note=German article in names and phrases
des x foreign note=French article in names and phrases
du x foreign note=French article in names and phrases
